%% Sequence diagram for contacting a professional on InvestAqary
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Browser
    participant Server
    participant MessageController
    participant Lead
    participant Conversation
    participant EmailService

    Client->>Browser: Open /contact/{pro}
    Browser->>Server: GET /contact/{pro}
    Server->>MessageController: showContactForm(pro)
    MessageController->>Lead: load professional info
    Lead-->>MessageController: professional profile
    MessageController-->>Server: render contact form
    Server-->>Browser: display form
    Client->>Browser: Submit contact form
    Browser->>Server: POST /contact/{pro}
    Server->>MessageController: sendContactForm(data)
    MessageController->>Lead: create lead record
    Lead-->>MessageController: lead saved
    MessageController->>Conversation: create conversation
    Conversation-->>MessageController: conversation ready
    MessageController->>EmailService: notify professional
    EmailService-->>MessageController: notification sent
    MessageController-->>Server: return success response
    Server-->>Browser: show confirmation message
    Browser-->>Client: Contact request sent
